'''Ninjas in Pyjamas''' is a [[:Category:Sweden|Swedish]] esports organization which was founded in 2000. They first began to compete in ''Counter-Strike 1.6'' until their dissolution in 2007. In 2012, the team returned with a ''Counter-Strike: Global Offensive'' squad. NiP also had ''Dota 2'', ''League of Legends'', ''Rainbow Six: Siege'' and ''Overwatch'' rosters before joining ''FIFA''.

